<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-16T22:10:00.605Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:10:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The RSF is under US pressure for a humanitarian truce as UN officials call for an immediate halt to drone strikes that are killing civilians across Sudan, including a market in Darfur where over 30 people died. The RSF also attacked a Red Crescent volunteer and a livestock market in Nyala, killing and injuring dozens of women and children, while the SAF blamed the RSF for a market bombing in Darfur. El Niño has contributed to a humanitarian crisis, killing hundreds of children. A Russian diplomat alleges that US weapons supplied to Ukraine have been found in RSF possession. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNWDAzVGRVMmhPY2JXaTBtYW5Ud2F4d3VrT2c2NnFGR2xuV3A0SFhSLXlFVlZYVzRodXNxaHpPMWxtS0lNYWxwa0pIQkVTQzNDdjFqRE5HaU51TFR3ZlZNZE12enNXX2ZfLXV1RDZDRHMxcktraDNzVFExeC0wTXhTY1U1V0xQN3hodWhpZ1JYakJEdEVmVGFnRGExUV9xX01rOUNXWDYzb3BQQnY4R0FEbVpQU2MwbC1uT2p6dXpHbXY3OXYxa3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;WTOP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNOExYZWw1NEtHMGUxN0xEWG8zY3dfdVBfOVNOb2x5TkZLd3VSVUxnVUFpNVVSVHozMWNhTVFFc1hrS3V4UTFvZG5UdlZTazMxbUp6ZWdKX1ppZUkyekJ3U3ROaGdlcVdNeFlGQU84SlB5QmV0WDZMbjY4UndpOG5mRVh5MGZTeHRLdVB6UkZHU2gzdUdZLVBlZlozamdKeExRY1VqWGppS05WOG1nd0ZyWFdPTktkblFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNaDVXQ1lEN21OZmV3cnNJd3VIZ3NNek40WXhXMExuQ2ZzNDNwcGIyUTN4QnBOV3A1N3FnaXQ5ZGZZMS1nRFp5THJ5UzRQbUJUOU5MY3I0Q2xPOGd2OXVLSG5ZUjcybU9SQjNzY01qRGxiV2FwQlpwNTRsZW1lZ0pCZWdwa1Z0c25fUWdZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news